# Tips (exactly 8 entries)
tips.1=Support the development - the donation link is coming soon.
tips.2=Did you know? The whole interface leans to the right. That is not a bug, that is the design.
tips.3=The hub covers 35 percent of your screen, so you can still see the game behind it.
tips.4=The music player really plays the audio files of the PhiClient/music folder.
tips.5=If you are reading this, three seconds of your life are gone. Thank you for your support.
tips.6=Your skin looks better in the hub than in the inventory screen. Just saying.
tips.7=There are eight tips in this list. You will never see all of them. Probably.
tips.8=Loading screens are just the game asking you to look at it for a moment.

